rs_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a></div></div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">112</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">342 (3,1 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">Norrköping</a> 6–0 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_V%C3%A4rnamo\" title=\"IFK Värnamo\">Värnamo</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(4 april 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a> 0–4 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(15 juni 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Brage\" title=\"IK Brage\">Brage</a> 3–4 <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Oddevold\" title=\"IK Oddevold\">Oddevold</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(12 april 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Högsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">12&#160;014. <a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborgs_IF\" title=\"Helsingborgs IF\">Helsingborg</a> 0–3 <a href=\"/wiki/Landskrona_BoIS\" title=\"Landskrona BoIS\">Landskrona</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(11 juni 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Lägsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">280. <a href=\"/wiki/Nordic_United_FC\" title=\"Nordic United FC\">Nordic</a> 3–3 <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Oddevold\" title=\"IK Oddevold\">Oddevold</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(27 juni 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2025\" title=\"Superettan 2025\">2025</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2027&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Superettan 2027 [inte skriven än]\">2027</a> &#8594;</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><small>All statistik korrekt per den 28 juni 2026.</small></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:354px;padding:4px;border:1px solid silver;margin:4px;background-color:white\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid silver;padding:0px;width:350px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Map_of_Sweden_(polar_stereographic).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg/500px-Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"350\" height=\"846\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg/960px-Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"365\" data-file-height=\"882\" /></a></span><br />\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:83.312799867391%; left:15.169301370299%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\