file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"font-size:75%;position:relative;top:3px;left:2px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a>&#160;</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:83.547655712635%; left:35.736730124095%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"font-size:75%;position:relative;top:3px;left:-2px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a>&#160;</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:40.924540127242%; left:33.993480462926%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"font-size:75%;position:relative;top:2px;left:2px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96stersunds_FK\" title=\"Östersunds FK\">Östersund</a>&#160;</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Superettan 2026.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Superettan 2026</b> är den tjugosjunde säsongen av <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan\" title=\"Superettan\">Superettan</a>, Sveriges näst högsta <a href=\"/wiki/Division_(sport)\" title=\"Division (sport)\">division</a> i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotboll\" title=\"Fotboll\">fotboll</a>, nivån under <a href=\"/wiki/Allsvenskan_(fotboll)\" title=\"Allsvenskan (fotboll)\">Allsvenskan</a>. På grund av att Superettan avslutas tre veckor före <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2026\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2026\">Allsvenskan 2026</a> har Svenska fotbollförbundet denna säsong infört ett playoffmöte mellan lagen som slutar på tredje- och fjärdeplats om vem som får kvala till Allsvenskan 2027.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2026&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2026&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Lag\n</th>\n<th>Län\n</th>\n<th>Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2025\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Falkenbergs_FF\" title=\"Falkenbergs FF\">Falkenbergs FF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hallands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Hallands län\"><img alt=\"Hallands län\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Halland_vapen.svg/20px-Halland_vapen.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Halland_vapen.svg/40px-Halland_vapen.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Hallands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Hallands län\">Halland</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Falkenberg\" title=\"Falkenberg\">Falkenberg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Falcon_Alkoholfri_Arena\" title=\"Falcon Alkoholfri Arena\">Falcon Alkoholfri Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gr%C3%A4smatta\" title=\"Gräsmatta\">Gräs</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5&#160;500\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span